== Trivia ==
* Tammy's Head is named after one of [[Edmund McMillen]]'s cats.
* When Repentance released, this item was removed from Golden Chests, but it wasn't added into any other item pool besides the {{m|Crane Game}}, effectively making it impossible to find normally. This was later rectified.

